# Third-party notices

## OpenCode

workmate bundles the OpenCode binary (`opencode-ai`, MIT) as its agent engine.
The binary is fetched at build time from npm at the version pinned in
`scripts/fetch-sidecar-binary.mjs` and is redistributed unmodified in the
application bundle. OpenCode is licensed under the MIT License; see
<https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode>.

## cowork-z

workmate is a separate application, not a fork of cowork-z
(<https://github.com/kevinlin/cowork-z>, MIT). No cowork-z source is included
here. Several of workmate's design choices were informed by reading it — notably
the api-key fingerprint bridge that keeps secrets out of the webview, readiness
by the engine's own `ready` event rather than process spawn, and shutdown on
`ExitRequested` so the engine is not orphaned. Acknowledged with thanks.

If cowork-z source is ever adapted into this repository, its copyright notice
and MIT permission notice must be reproduced here and shipped in the app bundle.
